---
description: Kubernetes manifest and container image conventions
globs:
  - "deploy/**"
  - "Dockerfile*"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Port conventions: training server 8000, prediction server 8001. Services:
  `training-service:8000` (ClusterIP), `prediction-service:80 -> 8001`.
- Training server: single replica, models on a ReadWriteOnce PVC. Prediction
  servers: horizontally scaled, per-pod `emptyDir` model cache — models move
  over HTTP only; never introduce a ReadWriteMany dependency.
- Every container needs `livenessProbe` on `/healthz` and `readinessProbe` on
  `/readyz`; the prediction server's readiness allows a generous
  `failureThreshold` because it must first download models.
- Config flows through ConfigMaps mapped to the env vars defined in
  `PredictSettings`/`Settings` — keep names identical to the code.
- This repo also ships as EPP sidecars upstream (gateway-api-inference-extension
  Helm chart); keep images topology-agnostic (no assumptions about Service DNS
  beyond `TRAINING_SERVER_URL`).
